{
  "description": "The proposal seeks consent for the installation of a new modern air source heat pump on the terrace of Flat 2, 15 Wetherby Gardens. The unit will be installed on anti-vibration mounts and concealed within an acoustic enclosure beneath the stairs leading to the terrace. The unit will not be visible from neighbouring properties or the public realm.\n\nThe external heat pump unit to be installed is a Daikin RXM50A8 R32 5.0kW air-source heat pump outdoor unit.\nConsider the public realm and the local greening. On top of the acoustic enclosure, it will be covered by planter with greenings and also the facade of the enclosure will be covered with greening.",
